    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n26 Lios Mor is a two-bedroom, second floor apartment, conveniently located in Newport Town, close to all local amenities. \n\nWith an internal floor area of approximately 60sqm/646sqft, accommodation consists of an entrance hall, open plan kitchen/living/dining room, two bedrooms and a bathroom. There is a small balcony off the living area and bedrooms. \n\nThe property is presented in good condition throughout, having been well maintained by its current owners. \n\nThis property would be suitable for someone looking to downsize closer to town. a first-time buyer, or as an investment opportunity. The main property is access via a keypad for extra security and there is a convenient lift to within a few feet of the apartment door. \n\nLios Mor is well located a short stroll from Newport Harbour at the mouth of Clew Bay. Newport town has seen an increase in visitors in the past few years due to its setting midway along the popular Great Western Greenway cycle and walking trail that runs from Westport town to Achill Island.\n\nThe property is within walking distance of Pre and Primary schools, shops, bars, restaurants and sports clubs."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.64m x 2.56m & 1.87m x 0.99m\nCarpeted floor\n\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room - 7m x 3.81m\nPart tiled/part carpeted, Cherrywood kitchen, integrated oven/hob, hotpress, electric heaters, door to balcony\n\nBedroom One - 3.47m x 2.62m\nCarpeted floor, built in wardrobe, door to balcony\n\nBedroom Two - 4.64m x 2.72m\nCarpeted floor, built in wardrobe, door to balcony\n\nBathroom - 2.3m x 1.66m\nFully tiled, shower, wc, whb\n\n"
      },
